  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c1a2f9ab33e780cba5010b6de702b28619de1d1b1c922808fce2123379d05d37.png] \n\nAfter interchanging × and -, the equations we get:\n\nl. 11 + 6 - 8 × __**8 ÷ 2**__ = 15\n\n→ 11 + 6 - __**8 **____**× 4**__ = 15\n\n→ __**11 + 6**__ - 32 = 15\n\n→ 17 - 32 = 15\n\n→ - 15 ≠ 15\n\n→ **LHS ≠** **RHS**\n\nII. 15 × 4 - 3 + __**6 ÷ 1**__ = 63\n\n→ __**15 **____**×**____** 4**__ - 3 + 6 = 63\n\n→ __**60**__ - 3 __**+ 6**__ = 63\n\n→ 66 - 3 = 63\n\n→ 63 = 63\n\n→ **LHS = RHS **\n\n→ Here, we can see that only equation II is correct.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Only II\"**.",
